  "releaseNotes": "0.8.0 closes the Studio compatibility findings with broader Python syntax and standard-library coverage; closes CLR global-value callbacks, rendering, and projection leaks; canonicalizes contained host paths; redacts host failures; tightens subprocess cwd/env/shell boundaries; completes host-call accounting; bounds frontend source and nesting; and enforces combined subprocess output limits.",
